---
description: Import-graph file placement; role folders; no feature-root barrels
alwaysApply: true
---

# Placement

Place files by **who imports them**, not by domain labels. Grep real importers (barrel re-exports do not count).

| Importers | Put the file |
|-----------|----------------|
| Exactly one | Inside that importer's folder |
| Two or more | Lowest shared parent of those paths |
| Unsure | Keep closer (single importer) until proven shared |

After a refactor, if a parent file has one consumer left, **move it down** in the same change.

# Layers (KirayeChat — not FSD)

```
src/app/              # Next routes only (page, layout). Not Vite providers/router.
src/features/{name}/  # listings | chat | auth | profile — domain lives here
src/components/ui/    # shadcn only
src/lib/supabase/     # clients + generated DB types
```

- `src/app` imports features. Features **never** import from `src/app`.
- Do **not** add `src/pages/`, `src/entities/`, or `src/shared/`.
- Keep `src/lib/supabase` and `src/components/ui` (do not rename to `helpers/` / `shared/ui`).

# Role folders (only if there is real code)

Fixed names inside a feature or unit: `ui` | `helpers` | `hooks` | `model` | `api`

- Folder = **what it does** (`listingCard`, `deleteModal`), not `listingsListingCard`.
- No empty role folders. No 7th top-level role (`utils`, `components`, `modals`, `services`, `types/`).
- Data: `queries.ts` / `actions.ts` at feature root when **two+** routes or units use them; if only one unit uses a query, nest it under that unit.
- No `mock/` unless a test/fixture file actually exists.

# Units and barrels

- UI unit: `ui/{camelCase}/index.tsx` + `type.ts` (props/local types). No loose `ListingCard.tsx` at feature root.
- **No** `features/{name}/index.ts`, **no** `src/app/index.ts`.
- Role barrel OK: `ui/index.ts` re-exports units only (no logic). Import `@/features/listings/ui` or the unit path.
- Types in `type.ts` next to the only consumer. Shared shapes: `model/` at lowest shared parent. DB rows: `src/lib/supabase/types.ts` only.

```
src/features/listings/
├── queries.ts
├── actions.ts
├── schema.ts
└── ui/
    ├── index.ts
    ├── listingCard/index.tsx + type.ts
    ├── listingFeed/
    └── listingForm/
```
